  "id": "hosteltakeover",
  "neon": "#ff4a3a",
  "note": "Hostel Takeover, 917,903: the free hostel beside the clone facility, where guests wake up. A dead signal box (brick locking room, glazed operating floor) with four storeys squatted on top of it in whatever was lying in the yard: a red container laid across the box, a blue one turned a quarter round on that, a corrugated shed on scaffold poles, and a plank cabin carrying the sign. Six storeys on purpose (flags.floors 6): it is the tallest thing at this end of the yards, so a new arrival can find their bed from the vats.\n\nThree signs, each saying something different: the name painted across the red container in yard-yellow stencil, the hanzi trade blade with a bed on it at the door, and FREE ROOMS in red tube on the roof, with a blink beside it so it reads as a tube that cuts out.",
